istItem","bullet","markDefs",[],"style","normal",{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":207,"_208":209},"0565a279f1e5","span","marks",[],"text","Energy-efficient construction","6e8a639e08a0",[213],[],{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":214,"_208":215},[],"Landscaped outdoor entertaining area","d364a05347c7",[219],[],{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":220,"_208":221},[],"Double garage","0259bf041217",[225],[],{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":226,"_208":227},[],"Engineered timber flooring","b5791400fc8c",[231],[],{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":232,"_208":233},[],"Luxury bathrooms with premium fixtures","1e24d983000c",[237],[],{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":238,"_208":239},[],"High ceilings throughout","de20ef939cf9",[243],[],{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":244,"_208":245},[],"Premium custom joinery","71b68b397045",[249],[],{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":250,"_208":251},[],"Designer kitchen with stone benchtops","b2ed5d9e6a14",[255],[],{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":256,"_208":257},[],"Open-plan kitchen, living and dining","0b90a2c8d0fd",[261],[],{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":262,"_208":263},[],"Double-storey family home","acf710faa369",[267],[],{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":268,"_208":269},[],"Contemporary architectural façade","d32ac9d41855",[273],[],{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":274,"_208":275},[],"Approximately 300sqm custom residence","11aefad74ad6",[280],[],"h3",{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":281,"_208":282},[],"Key Features","77a2c53a98bf",[286],[],{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":287,"_208":288},[],"Siari Build managed every stage of the project, from planning and permits through to construction and final handover. By maintaining strict quality control and open communication throughout the build, we delivered a beautifully finished custom home that exceeded the client’s expectations while maintaining a smooth and efficient construction process.","0ed0ca0b575e",[292],[],{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":293,"_208":294},[],"Our Solution","d0342d62e652",[298],[],{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":299,"_208":300},[],"The goal was to create a modern family home that balanced contemporary design with everyday practicality while remaining within the client’s budget. Achieving premium finishes, functional living spaces and efficient construction required careful planning, strong project management and close coordination with consultants and trades throughout every stage of the build.","ac4e69b9998b",[304],[],{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":305,"_208":306},[],"The Challenge","040a85be5f6a",[310],[],{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":311,"_208":312},[],"Constructed through Siari Build’s complete design-to-handover service, the project reflects our commitment to quality craftsmanship, attention to detail and delivering exceptional outcomes for our clients.","5a7e4e09f699",[316],[],{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":317,"_208":318},[],"The Fraser Rise Residence is a contemporary double-storey custom home designed to combine modern architecture with practical family living. At approximately 300sqm, this residence showcases clean architectural lines, quality finishes and thoughtfully designed living spaces, delivering a home that is both functional and timeless.","afdadf349b69",[323],[],"h2",{"_189":204,"_191":205,"_206":324,"_208":325},[],"Overview",{"_327":328,"_329":330,"_331":332,"_333":-5},"settings",{"_392":393,"_333":-5,"_394":395,"_396":397,"_398":399,"_400":-5,"_401":113,"_402":403,"_404":-5,"_405":406,"_407":355,"_408":-5,"_409":-5,"_410":355,"_411":412,"_413":414,"_415":416,"_417":418,"_419":-5,"_420":421,"_422":423,"_140":424,"_425":426,"_427":428},"navigation",{"_352":353,"_354":355,"_356":357,"_358":359},"services",[334,335,336,337,338,339],"businessImage",{"_208":350,"_30":351},{"_208":348,"_30":349},{"_208":346,"_30":347},{"_208":344,"_30":345},{"_208":342,"_30":343},{"_208":340,"_30":341},"Extra space for family, guests or rental income - designed and built properly, not bolted on.","Granny Flats","From a single kitchen to a whole-home transformation - old bones, new life.","Renovations","More room without the move. Ground-floor and second-storey extensions that look like they were always there.","Extensions & Additions","Dual occupancies and townhouses that get the most out of your site — and your return.","Multi-Dwelling Developments","Already have plans or an architect? We build to your design with the rigour it deserves.","Bespoke Builds","Architecturally led homes built around how you actually live — not a catalogue floor plan.","Custom Homes","footerMenu",[381,382,383,384,385,386],"headerCtaEnabled",true,"headerMenu",[366,367,368,369],"socialMenu",[360],{"_361":-5,"_362":-5,"_363":364,"_153":365},"hideFromMenu","icon","label","Instagram","https://www.instagram.com/siari_build/",{"_363":-5,"_371":379,"_373":380},{"_363":-5,"_371":377,"_373":378},{"_363":-5,"_371":375,"_373":376},{"_363":370,"_371":372,"_373":374},"Start Your Project","pageSlug","contact","pageTitle","Contact","projects","Projects","about","About","home","Home",{"_363":-5,"_371":379,"_373":380},{"_363":-5,"_371":377,"_373":378},{"_363":-5,"_371":375,"_373":376},{"_363":-5,"_371":372,"_373":374},{"_363":389,"_371":390,"_373":391},{"_363":-5,"_371":387,"_373":388},"privacy-policy","Privacy Policy","FAQ","faq","Frequently Asked Questions","address","Point Cook, Victoria","copyrightText","All rights reserved.","email","info@siaribuild.com.au","legalLine","ABN 20 688 039 894 | Builder License CDB-U 101713","logo","maintenanceEnabled","maintenanceHeading","WE'RE ON THE TOOLS.","maintenanceImage","maintenanceMessage","The site's getting a quick upgrade and will be back shortly. In the meantime, if you'd like to start a project, reach us using the options below.","maintenanceShowContact","mapAddressLabel","mapAreaRadius","mapHidePin","mapLocation",{"_191":429,"_146":430,"_431":432,"_433":434},"mapZoom",12,"notFoundButtonLabel","Back to Home","notFoundHeading","THIS ONE'S OFF THE PLANS.","notFoundImage","notFoundMessage","The page you're after isn't here — moved, renamed